00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
You ask AI to build something. It gets to work.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:13,000
A page can look good and still miss something important.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,000
A skill is a reusable set of instructions for your AI assistant.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Look at the real project, find gaps, and agree what success means.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Recall past decisions. Challenge the plan. Define how to check the result.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:45,000
The example plan requires checking that one time cannot be booked twice.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Install Plan Hygiene, open your project in Claude Code or Codex, and ask.

8
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000
